sequenceDiagram
    actor PM
    participant UI
    participant Backend
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant Q as Qdrant P1 Optional
    participant AIGW as AI Gateway
    participant API as AI API

    PM->>UI: Create task / ask recommend assignee
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/ai/jobs task_recommendation
    Backend->>DB: Load skills, workload, history
    Backend->>Backend: Deterministic rule score
    alt P1 semantic enabled
        Backend->>Q: Search similar tasks/meeting evidence
        Q-->>Backend: Similar evidence
    end
    alt Confidence high
        Backend-->>UI: Candidate ranking without AI call
    else Need explanation
        Backend->>AIGW: Request AI explanation with compact context
        AIGW->>API: Generate reasons/risks
        API-->>AIGW: Explanation JSON
        AIGW->>DB: Usage ledger/cache
        Backend-->>UI: Ranked candidates + reason
    end
    PM->>UI: Confirm assignee
    UI->>Backend: PATCH task assignee
    Backend->>DB: Save official assignment + audit
